{"title":"SSDT","slug":"SSDT","html":"<div class=\"wk-navbox\">\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-title\">\n<p><a data-wiki=\"ACPI\" href=\"#/library/ACPI\">ACPI</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\"></span> <a data-wiki=\"RSDP\" href=\"#/library/RSDP\">RSDP</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">Fixed Tables</span> <a data-wiki=\"BGRT\" href=\"#/library/BGRT\">BGRT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"FADT\" href=\"#/library/FADT\">FADT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"MADT\" href=\"#/library/MADT\">MADT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"RSDT\" href=\"#/library/RSDT\">RSDT</a>/<a data-wiki=\"XSDT\" href=\"#/library/XSDT\">XSDT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"SRAT\" href=\"#/library/SRAT\">SRAT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"WAET\" href=\"#/library/WAET\">WAET</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">Differentiated Tables</span> <a data-wiki=\"DSDT\" href=\"#/library/DSDT\">DSDT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"SSDT\" href=\"#/library/SSDT\">SSDT</a> · <a data-wiki=\"AML\" href=\"#/library/AML\">AML</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">Tools/Libs</span> <a data-wiki=\"ACPICA\" href=\"#/library/ACPICA\">ACPICA</a> · <a data-wiki=\"UACPI\" href=\"#/library/UACPI\">uACPI</a> · <a data-wiki=\"LAI\" href=\"#/library/LAI\">LAI</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><em>This page is about the ACPI SSDT (Secondary System Descriptor Table)</em> It contains additional AML to interact with devices.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ssdt\">SSDT</h2>\n<h3 id=\"introduction\">Introduction</h3>\n<div class=\"wk-note wk-stub\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-note-label\">Stub</span></p>\n<p>This page on the OSDev Wiki is a stub: it covers the basics but is not complete.</p>\n</div>\n<p>The SSDT is an ACPI decriptor table. It is encoded in AML in exactly the same way as the <a data-wiki=\"DSDT\" href=\"#/library/DSDT\">DSDT</a>. It acts as a supplement to the DSDT.</p>\n<h2 id=\"see_also\">See Also</h2>\n<h3 id=\"articles\">Articles</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a data-wiki=\"DSDT\" href=\"#/library/DSDT\">DSDT</a></li>\n<li><a data-wiki=\"RSDT\" href=\"#/library/RSDT\">RSDT</a></li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[{"id":"ssdt","text":"SSDT","level":2},{"id":"introduction","text":"Introduction","level":3},{"id":"see_also","text":"See Also","level":2},{"id":"articles","text":"Articles","level":3}],"categories":["ACPI","Stubs"],"rating":null,"flags":["stub"],"words":103,"summary":"This page is about the ACPI SSDT (Secondary System Descriptor Table) It contains additional AML to interact with devices.","updated":"2023-07-10","authors":["Khaledhammouda"],"url":"https://wiki.osdev.org/SSDT","history":"https://wiki.osdev.org/index.php?title=SSDT&action=history","backlinks":[{"t":"ACPI","s":"ACPI"},{"t":"ACPICA","s":"ACPICA"},{"t":"AML","s":"AML"},{"t":"BGRT","s":"BGRT"},{"t":"DSDT","s":"DSDT"},{"t":"FADT","s":"FADT"},{"t":"LAI","s":"LAI"},{"t":"MADT","s":"MADT"},{"t":"RSDP","s":"RSDP"},{"t":"RSDT","s":"RSDT"},{"t":"SRAT","s":"SRAT"},{"t":"UACPI","s":"UACPI"},{"t":"XSDT","s":"XSDT"}],"lessons":[{"id":"t11m1l2","title":"AML and choosing an ACPI library","kind":"further"}]}